  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAF: Airfreight, Exhibition to Sida 17 Dec - RAF: Airfreight, Exhibition to</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAF: Flygfrakt, utst&#xe4;llning till Sida 17 Dec</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska bilaterala samarbetet med Sydafrika och sex andra medelinkomstl&#xe4;nder upph&#xf6;rde i december 2013. Den 17 December 2013 var Sida Stockholm v&#xe4;rd f&#xf6;r en dag av erfarenhetsutbyte och n&#xe4;tverksbyggande med fokus p&#xe5; drivkrafter f&#xf6;r ett h&#xe5;llbart samarbete. Tv&#xe5; utst&#xe4;llningar som gjorts av ambassaden visade p&#xe5; samarbetet mellan Sverige och Sydafrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish bilateral cooperation with South Africa and six other middle-income countries came to an end in December 2013. On the 17 December 2013 Sida Stockholm hosted a day of experience sharing and networking focusing on driving forces for sustainable cooperation. Two exhibitions made by the Embassy showcasing the cooperation between Sweden and South Africa were used as part of the display.</narrative>
  </description>
